# Instructions & Operations Manifest

See full markdown instructions in `instructions.md`.

## Single-Command Production Execution
```bash
npm run start:all
```
- Concurrently launches FastAPI backend on `:8000` and Vite frontend on `:5173`.
- Root orchestration powered by `concurrently`.

## Individual Services
```bash
npm run start:backend     # Uvicorn app.main:app on 8000
npm run start:frontend    # Vite React on 5173
npm run seed              # Seed Operation Golden Vineyard demo
```

## System Verification
```bash
python3 validate_full_pipeline.py
python3 -m pytest
```
